    "description": {
      "value": "Mist fills the glass of this small circular hand mirror, creating strange patterns in the shifting gray wisps. The back of the mirror bears a flowing script engraving in an unknown language.\n\nThe spell DC of any spell cast by activating this item is 23.\n\n- - **Armor:** After you cast an illusion spell by activating the mirror, choose one ally within 30 feet. That ally gains a single illusory image, per mirror image. The image lasts until the end of your next turn if not destroyed before then.\n- - **Weapon:** After you cast an illusion spell by activating the mirror, illusory copies of the weapon swirl in the air around it. You're affected by the thicket of knives spell until the end of your next turn. The spell ends if you stop wielding the affixed weapon.\n\nYou cast forbidding ward.\n\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou cast mirror image."
    },
